s://x.com/PForever0000/status/2113737714839495144"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113741512114577408"]}, "author_id": "1614608796973928448", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:17:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113741515184800052"], "id": "2113741515184800052", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "엔비디아가 삼성하고 마이크론한테 NVHBM 베이스다이를 TSMC 3나노로 만들라고 요청했대.\n\n삼성이랑 마이크론은 동의했고 양산은 2027년 예상이야. SK하이닉스는 이미 TSMC 쓰고 있고.\n\nBernstein이 수출 데이터로 추정한 3분기 HBM 매출은 삼성 87억 달러, SK하이닉스 76억 달러로 삼성이 앞섰어. https://t.co/CdsxXEii3h", "url": "https://x.com/Richdorai/status/2113741515184800052"}, {"author_id": "186611769", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:33:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113745686999253045"], "id": "2113745686999253045", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 162, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113507802207625390", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Q3 레포트 업데이트 : ASML, TSMC, SpaceX, Tesla, Meta     \n\n구독료 할인행사 중(9/2~11/1) : $5 -&gt; $1                        \n\n주요 기업 Earnings Analysis          \n\nAI 자율주행/ 로봇            \n\n1. TSLA(Korean) Q3.2026 : https://t.co/fPXfu5amHB              \n2. TSLA(English)", "url": "https://x.com/PForever0000/status/2113745686999253045"}, {"author_id": "1196304745603817472", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:20:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113742292607697050"], "id": "2113742292607697050", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 197, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "So is the AI boom being halted just because TSMC doesn’t have enough room in their fabs to accommodate more equipment from ASML, Lam, KLAC, and Applied Materials?", "url": "https://x.com/dissectmarkets/status/2113742292607697050"}, {"author_id": "186611769", "created_at": "2026-10-23T21:05:04.000Z", "edit_